&lt;p&gt;5 BCE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="excavation-dates"&gt;Excavation Dates&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;unexcavated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="garden-description"&gt;Garden Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These vineyards (&lt;em&gt;ἄμπελοι&lt;/em&gt;) with a rose garden (&lt;em&gt;ῥοδεών&lt;/em&gt;) and fava bean gardens (&lt;em&gt;κυαμῶνες&lt;/em&gt;) were in in wetlands on the Strip (cf. &lt;a href="https://roman-gardens.github.io/test-drafts/id/05b24acec3/"&gt;Garden at Kanopos&lt;/a&gt;). Size: 4.5 ar. (1.24 ha.)&lt;!-- check units --&gt; in two parcels, of which lessors own two-thirds share. Leased in 5 BCE for 5 years.&lt;/p&gt;
